<title>SOUTH KOREA: Ssangyong Oil to close CDU for 4-5 days.</title>
<headline>Ssangyong Oil to close CDU for 4-5 days.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Ssangyong Oil Refining Co plans to close down its No 3 200,000 barrels-per-day crude distillation unit on Thursday for four to five days, a company official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The official declined to give the reasons behind the planned closure.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
